        "text": "To some specialists, technical analysis creates a self fulfilling prophecy. Technical analysts make market predictions using the same techniques and indicators. If enough traders and analysts also believe the same predictions, this can change trading behavior and confirm the predictions. This potential effect means that technical analysis can be effective sometimes and unreliable in other situations. On the other hand, technical analysis supporters argue there's a large range of opinions and analysis methods. This means that the chances of a large group of traders making the same analysis and behaving similarly is very low.",
